                                    "title": "Watermark",
                                    "description": "Configuration object for adding watermarks to generated videos. Watermarks can be applied using either text or image content with customizable positioning and appearance. You must provide either `text` or `image` content for the watermark, but not both.\n\n**Text watermark**:\n\n```json\n\"advancedFeatures\": {\n  \"watermark\": {\n    \"text\": \"© 2025 Company\",\n    \"displayPosition\": \"bottom-right\",\n    \"opacity\": 0.6,\n    \"fontColor\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"bgColor\": \"#000000\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Image watermark**:\n\n```json\n\"advancedFeatures\": {\n  \"watermark\": {\n    \"image\": \"c64351d5-4c59-42f7-95e1-eace013eddab\",\n    \"displayPosition\": \"top-left\",\n    \"opacity\": 0.6\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Tiled watermark**:\n\n```json\n\"advancedFeatures\": {\n  \"watermark\": {\n    \"text\": \"PREVIEW\",\n    \"tiled\": true,\n    \"opacity\": 0.4,\n    \"fontColor\": \"#cccccc\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n[Read full documentation](https://runware.ai/docs/models/meta-muse-image#watermark)",
                                    "type": "object",
